{"i":580,"type":"thought","stage":"crusher","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Eli","text":"Cole is my pact, but holding endangers me. I might push someone to force the lever to save me, but betraying Cole or Hana hurts jury. Letting Ash or Cole hold is ideal; maybe I push Ash to make him a target, but that risks my own survival if no holder."}
